			; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">termes ramus desectus ex arbore nec foliis
					repletus, ac nimis glaber,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Fest. p. 367</span></i>
			 Müll.</div>
